sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser UI
    participant G as YARP gateway
    participant A as API request pipeline
    participant H as API handler (in process)
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over U,D: Planned API ownership boundary; each call is one synchronous operation
    U->>G: 1 Create, submit or decision request
    G->>A: Forward HTTP
    A->>H: 2 Authenticated identity and valid CSRF proof
    H->>H: Check role and payload
    H->>D: 3 Short transaction
    Note over H,D: Create: unique request key; submit/decision: actor, state and expected version
    Note over H,D: Successful change and transition audit commit together
    D-->>H: Committed result or conflict
    H-->>A: Safe response
    A-->>G: Status and JSON
    G-->>U: 4 Response
    U->>U: 5 Render persisted state or recoverable error
    Note over U,D: Rejected identity/proof/role returns early without a successful mutation
